# 复制成 .env.local（不进 git），填好后重新运行 npm run dev。
# Copy to .env.local (git-ignored), fill in, then restart npm run dev.
#
# 一个都不填也能运行：只能看示例数据，不保存、不取行情。
# Leave everything empty to run with sample data only: nothing is saved and no quotes are fetched.

# Supabase：Project Settings → API 里的项目地址和 publishable key。它们本来就会出现在网页里，不是机密。
# Supabase project URL and publishable key (Project Settings → API). Both end up in the web page anyway; they are not secrets.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=

# 行情 Worker 的地址（worker/ 目录，部署见 DEPLOY.md）。不填就不取行情。本机调试 Worker 时填 http://localhost:8787
# URL of the quotes Worker (worker/, see DEPLOY.md). Leave empty to skip quotes. For a local Worker use http://localhost:8787
VITE_API_BASE=
